Module
  name: game_spellranks
  description: Spell ranks, Forms, combos and awakening (O686). The rank bars, the Upgrades tab (Forms and Awakening views) and the Form picker of the Spellbook (game_spellbook), the awakened spell names, the hub badge of the Spellbook card, the combo label and chime; extended opcode 168. Behind the server's switch: nothing shows while the server reports it off. Also the generated Forms data (forms_data.lua) and awakened names and signatures (awakened_data.lua)
  author: Cinders of Chaos
  sandboxed: true
  scripts: [ forms_data, awakened_data, ranklogic, combologic, awakelogic, spellranks ]
  dependencies:
    - client_chaos_locale
    - client_chaos_theme
  autoload: true
  autoload-priority: 999
  @onLoad: init()
  @onUnload: terminate()
